	(text "Battery 2S-3S LiPo (6-12.6 V) on XT30. AO4407A: reverse polarity protection (gate to GND).\nSMAJ15A clamps transients. VBAT_SENSE = VBAT * 10k/43k (12.6 V -> 2.93 V).\nTPS563201 buck -> V5_SERVO (5.07 V, 3 A) for servos and receiver.\n+5V (logic) = V5_SERVO or USB VBUS, each via B5819W; AP2112K-3.3 for the MCU."
